What:		/sys/kernel/radio_bridge/audio_path
Date:		December 2025
KernelVersion:	6.12.52-android16-6
Description:
		Control the audio path between the AOSS and the modem.
		Writing "on" to this node will get the radio bridge to
		first make sure PCIe is linked up and then notify the
		AOSS to setup the audio path. Once the audio path has been
		setup, the sysfs node will be updated to the new value.
		Userspace will use this node to make sure the audio path
		has been established before sending out the speech on
		command to the modem.

		The sequence is reversed in case of the speech off command
		where the userspace notifies the radio bridge after the speech
		off command, that the audio path is safe to tear down. Then
		the radio bridge can notify the AOSS and link down PCIe.

